Package: lines-logos
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Trey Smith <trey@linesandlogos.team>
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), adduser
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://linesandlogos.team
Description: Lines & Logos Business OS — marketing site + business operating system
 (sales/ops/finance agents, crew portal, customer portal, invoicing, careers/ATS)
 in one zero-dependency Node.js server. First person to open the app creates
 the owner account; the built-in go-live wizard handles Stripe live keys.
